  "expected": "inherit",
  "hint": "rename \`inhert\` to \`inherit\` in boot.yml; if the role is a package you do not own, report it to that package; until its fix ships, a clone boots the role refs-only, or enroll without it (--roles -<role>) — every boot of the role reads this file"
}"
`;

exports[`parseRoleBootYaml given: [case15] a subject that declares its \`always\` inheritance when: [t2] the inner always key is misspelled then: it throws rather than inherit in silence, and names the key 1`] = `
